   "widgets_values": [
    "# Your first game\n\n1. Press **Run** (Ctrl+Enter).\n2. Click the game in **Build & Play Game** to play it.\n\nEverything you don't specify is generated: pixel art, levels, music, sound effects, boss.\n\n* Change **seed** for a new variation\n* Try another **genre** or **theme**\n* Open the **ComfyGame** sidebar tab for your library and the AI studio\n\nControls: arrows/WASD, Space jump, Shift dash, Esc pause."
